Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.56,0:00:04.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哈 哈 哈 哈 哈 哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.98,0:00:14.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.22,0:00:17.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.68,0:00:27.22,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,早安！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.51,0:00:29.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.96,0:00:32.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈 哈 哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.89,0:00:34.50,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.91,0:00:37.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看樣子就知道了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.03,0:00:40.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想著來跑步鍛鍊一下身體
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.66,0:00:43.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能給小晴幫上點忙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.11,0:00:48.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是俗話說得對啊 “千里之行始於足下”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.72,0:00:50.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這句話什麼意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.53,0:00:54.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意思是 “必須要靠著日益積累的努力 才能獲得成功"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.85,0:00:57.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,金句良言啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.98,0:00:59.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.24,0:01:05.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 你是什麼時候學會的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.38,0:01:08.45,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,1天記5個字 一天天積累起來的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.39,0:01:13.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要是每天都堅持晨跑的話
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.24,0:01:15.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是就能變得像小晴那麼厲害？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.56,0:01:22.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.38,0:01:24.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我不是那個意思
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.75,0:01:30.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學... 保持現在這樣就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.86,0:01:33.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.89,0:01:34.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,（咕）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.07,0:01:37.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.31,0:01:38.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.73,0:01:41.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哼哼 要奔起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.22,0:01:42.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.40,0:01:45.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,-啊哈哈哈哈...   {\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&}-呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.16,0:03:24.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}我也是英雄少女！Cure Prism登場!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.16,0:03:24.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}{\fs50}Hero Girl　                 稜鏡愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.70,0:03:31.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（門鈴聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.43,0:03:32.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦喲？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.47,0:03:34.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大清早的 是誰啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.23,0:03:35.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我去開門
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.84,0:03:39.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,久等了...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.12,0:03:42.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈！好久不見！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.26,0:03:45.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一陣子不見 人長高了 連髮型都換了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.14,0:03:48.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？這髮色好像有點...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.77,0:03:50.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是誰啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.49,0:03:51.86,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我才要問呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.37,0:03:53.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.90,0:03:55.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小白
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.31,0:03:56.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼來了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.82,0:03:59.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我來這邊處理一點事情
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.26,0:04:01.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這位是誰啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.78,0:04:07.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很久很久以前 天窗市有著兩個小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.47,0:04:09.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,名字叫做小蝶和小白
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.84,0:04:14.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,2個人是鄰居 但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.97,0:04:16.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為母親的工作需要
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.14,0:04:19.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶搬去了很遠的另一個城市
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.80,0:04:23.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,“ 討厭媽媽！我要離家出走！”
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.54,0:04:27.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼離開家的小蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.47,0:04:29.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來會遇到什麼事呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.36,0:04:32.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}遇... 遇到什麼事了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.36,0:04:32.29,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.51,0:04:35.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再繼續下去天都要黑了 簡短一點
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.89,0:04:38.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是啊 咳咳
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.69,0:04:40.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫聖蝶華！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.70,0:04:43.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,18歲 B型血
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.72,0:04:45.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誕生石是橄欖石
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.72,0:04:45.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1080,960)}Peridot
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.86,0:04:47.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸運色是寶貝粉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.86,0:04:47.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1085,960)}Baby Pink
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.26,0:04:54.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近沉迷 英式紅茶拿鐵 加白巧克力 再狂加奶油
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.26,0:04:54.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}English Tea Latte with White Chocolate ad Extra Whip
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.68,0:04:56.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完畢 該你了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.75,0:04:58.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,初...初次見面！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.58,0:05:01.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我是暫居在這裡的 名字叫做小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.17,0:05:03.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是本地人嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.64,0:05:04.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.82,0:05:07.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我是和小空一起 從另一個世界來的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.20,0:05:09.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另一個世界？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.70,0:05:11.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暫停！（哨聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.59,0:05:14.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.10,0:05:16.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大... 大意了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.35,0:05:18.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,為了不引起騷動 關於藍天大地的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.35,0:05:18.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1170,960)}Sky Land
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.40,0:05:20.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,還有小空是公主的事情 都需要保密的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.87,0:05:22.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,明明跟真白同學約定的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.64,0:05:23.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公主？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.06,0:05:24.94,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.11,0:05:26.84,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}完蛋了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.11,0:05:26.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！哇！哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.21,0:05:31.39,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶姐 剛才你聽到的 就當作是耳邊風吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.00,0:05:33.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然有事要瞞我？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.67,0:05:36.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉 小蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.64,0:05:40.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朋友之間的秘密 不能說的吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.03,0:05:42.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.16,0:05:42.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&}-欸？  {\r}-欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.24,0:05:46.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過啊 還是希望能找一天 全都告訴我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.27,0:05:49.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就這樣了 請多關照了 小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.63,0:05:52.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有... 小空
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.74,0:05:54.02,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.59,0:05:57.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈！好可愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.31,0:05:58.93,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,愛咿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.48,0:06:00.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&}-哈...      {\r}-哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.45,0:06:07.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 話說回來 小蝶你要來處理的是什麼事情？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.60,0:06:10.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,命運又開始轉動了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.98,0:06:09.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(960,950)}很想知道嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.47,0:06:11.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(960,950)}嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.30,0:06:13.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有那麼好奇嗎？真的想知道嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.24,0:06:14.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.84,0:06:16.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼要專門來我們這裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.81,0:06:20.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你現在居住的地方 也有幼兒師範學校的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.58,0:06:25.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我聽說這裡的教育方針 會更重視如何貼近小朋友的心理
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.07,0:06:31.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以在入學前 想直接與校長見上一面 聊一聊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.95,0:06:33.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請多多指點
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.24,0:06:37.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的目標是成為最強的保育員！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.27,0:06:41.28,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.47,0:06:43.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是培養保育員的學校哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.27,0:06:45.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,保育員？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.70,0:06:48.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是照顧幼兒們的老師
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.83,0:06:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}天窗市社會福祉幼兒師範專科學校
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.23,0:06:53.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶從小就一直說 以後要當保育員
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.60,0:06:54.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.11,0:06:58.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了理想而努力 很了不起吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.38,0:07:02.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 小空長大了 想要從事什麼職業？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.88,0:07:05.16,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.36,0:07:08.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈... 對小空來說 還太早了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.22,0:07:11.68,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼真白同學想要做什麼呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.93,0:07:14.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我嗎？我啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.79,0:07:18.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,並沒有什麼計劃
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.35,0:07:21.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說起來 班上的同學們...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.40,0:07:24.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要當插畫家
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.06,0:07:26.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,考公吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.66,0:07:29.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要做一個C站播主
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.66,0:07:29.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1120,960)}CureTuber
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.46,0:07:34.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知不覺間 就已經到了必須要決定出路的時候了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.82,0:07:39.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是重審了一下自己 我也沒什麼很擅長的事情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.09,0:07:44.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種人能做什麼 是一個難題啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.92,0:07:45.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.28,0:07:54.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？怎麼回事？小豬？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.19,0:07:56.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說話那個陷阱是怎麼回事？上世紀的陷阱？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.19,0:07:56.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1220,960)}昭和
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.04,0:08:00.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有那個毒蘑菇 是上次在小溪那邊見到過的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.91,0:08:03.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,噗噗 噗噗 注視
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.21,0:08:08.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太刻意了 不管是橫過來還是豎著看 都是卡疤痛的陷阱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.70,0:08:10.81,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小豬遇到危險了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.96,0:08:12.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不對 那是陷阱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.49,0:08:16.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好危險啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.26,0:08:19.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小豬 不知道那個是陷阱嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.39,0:08:20.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以靠近的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.14,0:08:22.29,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤痛痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.44,0:08:23.20,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.72,0:08:27.11,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,咳咳... 是你...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.32,0:08:31.37,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,欸嘿嘿 你卡疤痛大爺變幻成小豬
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.53,0:08:34.37,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,連佛祖都分辨不出來！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.53,0:08:36.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你... 你也太狡猾了...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.85,0:08:38.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是在演小品嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.48,0:08:39.28,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 小空
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.79,0:08:41.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你搞這種花樣 有什麼陰謀嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.93,0:08:44.54,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,還沒有發覺呢？哼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.99,0:08:45.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.03,0:08:49.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 還給我啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.40,0:08:54.05,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧！暗塌谷能量！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.93,0:09:04.93,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.20,0:09:09.26,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呀哈哈哈！你已經無法變身成為Precure了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.43,0:09:11.03,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不足為懼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.85,0:09:14.66,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我可要收下小空公主了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.34,0:09:17.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這... 這是發生什麼事情了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.97,0:09:21.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是啊 校長 你問我 我都不知道該問誰啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.98,0:09:29.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不變身成Cure Sky的話 無法與亂暴獸對峙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.20,0:09:31.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼辦...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.27,0:09:32.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.00,0:09:35.26,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.06,0:09:38.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.37,0:09:39.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.48,0:09:45.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小白！過來！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.33,0:09:46.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.48,0:09:49.85,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託你了！把小空帶到安全的地方！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.10,0:09:51.41,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.70,0:09:52.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.25,0:09:59.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到裡面去！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.17,0:10:01.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那傢伙身體巨大 進不來教學樓裡的！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.94,0:10:05.51,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,真是想當然
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.14,0:10:09.50,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.80,0:10:11.16,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,去抓住她們！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.32,0:10:13.05,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.91,0:10:18.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我來抱小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.96,0:10:21.28,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.73,0:10:23.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這究竟是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.43,0:10:27.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴... 小晴...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.46,0:10:29.37,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.58,0:10:32.12,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.90,0:10:52.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不怕不怕 小空
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.78,0:10:54.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐們會保護你的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.35,0:10:58.30,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 試音 試音
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.58,0:11:00.50,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,放棄無謂的抵抗！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.76,0:11:02.93,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上帶著小公主出來！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.00,0:11:06.45,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 你也說兩句啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.70,0:11:08.16,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,“是我們輸了”
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.37,0:11:10.55,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,“向卡疤痛先生賠禮道歉吧”
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.72,0:11:12.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學！不能出來！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.97,0:11:14.62,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,鎖你嘴巴！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.97,0:11:14.62,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}（幼兒語）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.38,0:11:18.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.33,0:11:19.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.91,0:11:22.49,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不出來啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.67,0:11:25.37,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼 那我就...（響指聲！）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.62,0:11:35.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能找到根金屬棒球棍的話 還能拼一下...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.95,0:11:39.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 太莽撞了！真是的 就沒有辦法了嗎...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.05,0:11:42.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必須去...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.68,0:11:44.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必須去救小晴...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.86,0:11:46.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.54,0:11:47.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我們要怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.64,0:11:59.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算沒辦法...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.15,0:12:04.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也必須要去啊！
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.15,0:12:04.27,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}我也必須要去啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.34,0:12:11.38,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.38,0:12:17.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那種光芒 難道是...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.95,0:12:19.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 喂 喂 喂...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.23,0:12:29.09,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 那個是！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.38,0:12:32.05,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,為... 為什麼那種龍套會變出來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.60,0:12:34.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這... 這是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.64,0:12:36.46,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.55,0:12:39.87,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這是我的...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.71,0:12:43.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我變身成Precure？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.82,0:12:48.08,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.31,0:12:52.46,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,跑龍套的怎麼能當Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.83,0:12:54.86,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你有什麼力量嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.55,0:12:58.71,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你自己應該拎得清的吧 沒錯吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.50,0:13:08.23,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,（撞門聲！）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.92,0:13:15.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要快點變身成Precure...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.28,0:13:18.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我這種人...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.93,0:13:22.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小白？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.97,0:13:26.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你拿上這支筆究竟會發生什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.57,0:13:28.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他說的Precure又是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.84,0:13:30.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是一點都不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.14,0:13:33.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 你不用顧慮...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.19,0:13:33.90,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,（撞門聲！）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.90,0:13:35.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那邊的煩死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.86,0:13:37.02,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.66,0:13:41.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小白 我要跟你說心裡話
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.46,0:13:45.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那一天...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.37,0:13:49.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要離家出走！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.26,0:13:56.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（哭泣聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.92,0:14:01.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在這裡啊 我們回家吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.77,0:14:07.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會給你寫信的 我會跟你打電話的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.76,0:14:13.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小白你就不難過嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.25,0:14:15.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難過啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.37,0:14:25.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我要是哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.79,0:14:28.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶會哭得比我更厲害吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.05,0:14:34.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那一天 小白教會了我一個道理
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.87,0:14:38.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,溫柔的心是很強大的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.45,0:14:43.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要說什麼 “我這種人”！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.88,0:14:46.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不能讓任何人說出這種話！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.40,0:14:51.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小白你有著名為溫柔的 不會輸給任何人的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.44,0:14:53.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.72,0:15:01.10,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學... 保持現在這樣就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.17,0:15:15.58,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.33,0:15:25.26,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,該看我英雄亮相了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.07,0:15:31.65,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,天空幻鏡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.07,0:15:31.65,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky Mirage！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.27,0:15:35.03,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,天籟接通！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.27,0:15:35.03,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Tone Connect！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.72,0:15:41.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,海闊天空變身！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.41,0:15:44.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,稜鏡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.41,0:15:44.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.73,0:15:54.14,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,閃耀起步！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.73,0:15:54.14,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}HOP
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.79,0:16:02.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,爽朗飛奔！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.79,0:16:02.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}STEP
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.43,0:16:10.08,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,暢快躍起！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.43,0:16:10.08,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}JUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.75,0:16:33.36,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,遼闊拂遠的柔光！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.39,0:16:35.66,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.39,0:16:35.66,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}稜鏡愈衛！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.80,0:16:55.71,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼... Cure... Prism
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.17,0:16:59.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太帥了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.51,0:17:00.90,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,空空
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.28,0:17:03.77,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,把... 把她揍個落花流水！亂暴獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.38,0:17:06.83,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.98,0:17:09.46,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂...暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.33,0:17:12.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.93,0:17:19.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 力量也太強了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.24,0:17:20.78,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.34,0:17:24.63,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴獸 就是現在 快抓住小公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.03,0:17:27.27,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.79,0:17:32.08,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,休想得逞！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.39,0:17:35.29,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.45,0:17:37.22,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,噠啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.64,0:17:39.43,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂... 暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.61,0:17:40.39,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.92,0:17:42.67,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哇哇哇哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.29,0:17:46.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.16,0:17:49.37,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.20,0:17:57.29,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.45,0:18:04.44,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂 亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.42,0:18:23.92,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.72,0:18:27.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,且看我英雄亮相！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.69,0:18:34.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空幻鏡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.69,0:18:34.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky Mirage！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.93,0:18:37.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天籟接通！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.93,0:18:37.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Tone Connect！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.58,0:18:44.24,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,海闊天空變身！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.93,0:18:46.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.93,0:18:46.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.98,0:18:56.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,閃耀起步！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.98,0:18:56.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}HOP
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.17,0:19:04.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,爽朗飛奔！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.17,0:19:04.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}STEP
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.89,0:19:12.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,暢快躍起！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.89,0:19:12.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}JUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.07,0:19:35.43,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,廣闊無限的藍天！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.67,0:19:37.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.67,0:19:37.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}天空愈衛！
