Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.33,0:19:47.04,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,給我上！亂暴獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.43,0:19:49.73,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.69,0:19:54.67,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不會讓你妨礙Cure Sky的！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.72,0:19:56.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.81,0:19:58.20,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.52,0:19:59.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.89,0:20:00.61,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.08,0:20:10.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.17,0:20:16.52,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.91,0:20:22.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女·天空拳
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.91,0:20:22.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Hero Girl Sky Punch
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.55,0:20:24.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.67,0:20:30.07,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然開朗
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.67,0:20:30.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然開朗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.94,0:20:41.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女·稜鏡光流
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.94,0:20:41.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Hero Girl Prism Shot
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.62,0:20:49.12,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然開朗
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.62,0:20:49.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然開朗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.40,0:20:56.88,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,太... 太強了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.92,0:21:00.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.20,0:21:04.57,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.83,0:21:06.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.30,0:21:12.75,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的 只是一放鬆下來 人就軟掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.83,0:21:15.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,對... 對不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.90,0:21:17.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,都怪我還不成熟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.41,0:21:20.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你們根本就不用管我這種人...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.44,0:21:23.27,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.42,0:21:24.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.78,0:21:25.79,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.95,0:21:27.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害 好厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.30,0:21:28.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們倆太厲害了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.55,0:21:32.63,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不能說 “我這種人”
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.76,0:21:39.57,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴可是我親愛的朋友啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.66,0:21:41.76,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.23,0:21:48.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.94,0:21:50.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都沒事就好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.87,0:21:52.11,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶才是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.25,0:21:54.63,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你保護了小空
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.77,0:21:55.60,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.76,0:21:57.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是剛才那驚天動地的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.81,0:22:00.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我當成耳邊風 當成過眼雲煙
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.24,0:22:01.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看樣子是辦不到了...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.07,0:22:04.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,-啊... 啊哈哈哈哈...   {\3c&HA384FB&\4c&HCAB8FF&}-啊... 啊哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.55,0:22:08.91,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Prism哦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.55,0:22:08.91,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1060,960)}稜鏡愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.25,0:22:12.07,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大家試著跟我一起跳舞吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.33,0:23:48.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,現在開始要好好努力了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.71,0:23:50.15,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 請多關照！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.32,0:23:51.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是... 是...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.66,0:23:52.76,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.95,0:23:53.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.14,0:23:55.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我一個人戰鬥吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.07,0:23:57.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.42,0:23:59.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.42,0:23:59.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海闊天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.75,0:24:03.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,手牽起了手！我們的新招！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.28,0:01:48.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（衝上藍天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.49,0:01:54.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 超越雲巔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.29,0:01:59.63,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飛吧！向著海闊天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.63,0:02:07.35,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空萬里 美麗藍天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.55,0:02:12.52,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨後初霽天空稜鏡折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.73,0:02:16.74,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天的景色預告著有好事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.74,0:02:18.23,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（藍天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.23,0:02:22.53,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要確認一下 便伸直了雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.12,0:02:27.11,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名為希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.20,0:02:29.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速緊握！緊緊握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.20,0:02:33.66,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,戰勝絕望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.05,0:02:37.63,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我們要堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.63,0:02:41.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦乾眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.67,0:02:41.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已經做好準備了嗎）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.00,0:02:43.01,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飛躍而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.42,0:02:43.01,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(讓我們張開勇氣之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.35,0:02:48.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 朝氣蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.97,0:02:53.43,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把煩躁化為光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.68,0:02:58.73,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未來的圖景 充滿著可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.90,0:03:03.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,與在同一片藍天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.86,0:03:06.28,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起喚起通向明日的奇蹟！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.40,0:03:14.29,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海闊天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.07,0:22:29.74,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了!! 晴空萬里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.74,0:22:34.33,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是能實現夢想與心願的蔚藍
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.50,0:22:37.08,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,打開心中的麥克風
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.08,0:22:38.92,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,輕輕哼唱起！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.92,0:22:41.30,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望的旋律♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.76,0:22:44.22,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}今天心情愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.22,0:22:46.18,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}如果能與你分享
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.18,0:22:48.85,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就能打開心靈+門扉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.93,0:22:51.64,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}稍等片刻！我已經激動到勢不可擋!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.64,0:22:53.31,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}笑容也在合唱！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.44,0:22:55.98,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧☆我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.09,0:23:02.53,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}還是那條街 {\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}就像平日裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.24,0:23:08.36,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在那裡 這便是奇蹟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.36,0:23:10.70,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的寶貝！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.41,0:23:15.08,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都過來！傳開這韻律
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.08,0:23:19.32,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,手牽起手 心連起心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.33,0:23:25.42,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,用溫暖的關懷 培育出的勇氣 是無窮無窮的∞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.51,0:23:29.68,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,積極的圖示是標記
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.68,0:23:33.85,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,想要更了解！這海闊天空的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.85,0:23:37.55,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我們展開翅膀 飛向藍天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.55,0:23:38.94,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,連接起人與人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.94,0:23:41.65,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure 笑容的圓環！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
